      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and compassionate veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the veterinary team, specifically highlighting Dr Michael, Dr Liam, and Dr Vici for their clinical expertise and supportive manner. Clients appreciate the friendly receptionists and dedicated nurses who go out of their way to assist during stressful visits. Despite one isolated complaint regarding communication, the overwhelming consensus praises the staff for exceptional dedication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling and calm environment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight the team's gentle, patient approach when examining dogs, cats, and exotic pets like rescued reptiles. Owners note that practitioners use soothing distraction techniques and treats to ensure visits remain low-stress for nervous animals. Pet parents frequently emphasize that their pets feel unusually comfortable and secure under the clinic's care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean clinic with feline area"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently describe the surgery as spotless, welcoming, and thoughtfully designed for animal comfort. Cat owners especially appreciate the dedicated feline-only consulting area, which prevents stressful interactions with barking dogs. While several reviewers note that on-street parking near the practice is limited, families praise the peaceful atmosphere inside the clinic."
      }
    }
  ],
